"""Test tools/golden, tools/hoon and tools/test-arms against
tools/testdata/stub.hoon, and tools/doc-blocks against Markdown it
writes.

    tools/testdata/selftest            all checks, about two minutes
    tools/testdata/selftest -k crash   only checks whose name has "crash"

The cases in tools/testdata/golden pass with the stub.  Each check that
needs a failure (a mismatch, a crash, a broken library) makes it in a
temporary copy, so the files here never change.  Exit status 0 when
every check passes.
"""

